[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:133. Sensational News]
[00:01.260]Lesson 133. | 第133课。
[00:04.200]Have you just made a new film, Miss Marsh? | 马什小姐，你刚拍了一部新电影吗？
[00:07.400]Yes, I have. | 是的，我拍了。
[00:09.430]Are you going to make another? | 你还要再拍一部吗？
[00:11.220]No, I'm not. | 不，我不拍了。
[00:13.100]I'm going to retire. | 我要退休了。
[00:15.195]I feel very tired. | 我觉得很累。
[00:17.580]I don't want to make another film for a long time. | 我很长一段时间都不想再拍电影了。
[00:22.145]Let's buy a newspaper, Millie. | 咪咪，我们买份报纸吧。
[00:25.560]Listen to this. | 听我说。
[00:27.705]Karen Marsh, sensational news by our reporter Alan Jones. | 凯伦·马什，本报记者艾伦·琼斯带来的轰动性新闻。
[00:34.230]Miss Karen Marsh arrived at London Airport today. | 凯伦·马什小姐今天抵达伦敦机场。
[00:38.950]She was wearing a blue dress and a mink coat. | 她穿着一件蓝色连衣裙和一件貂皮大衣。
[00:42.760]She told me she had just made a new film. | 她告诉我她刚拍了一部新电影。
[00:46.580]She said she was not going to make another. | 她说她不打算再拍一部了。
[00:49.785]She said she was going to retire. | 她说她要退休了。
[00:52.610]She told reporters she felt very tired and didn't want to make another film for a long time. | 她告诉记者们她感到非常疲惫，并且很长一段时间都不想再拍电影了。
[00:59.630]Well fancy that, Kate. | 凯特，真有趣。